Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  菜看起来都好棒啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, all this food looks wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该考虑走这一行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should think about doing this for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我有头皮屑  你也不必指着我笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I have dandruff. There's no need to laugh and point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  钱德是在笑你的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad, Chandler was laughing at yourjoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的笑话又不好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My joke wasn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我刚刚想到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚梦到盖勒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had a dream about Mr. Geller last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我梦到他把我从火场救出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I dreamt that he saved me from a burning building...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好英勇好强壮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he was so brave and so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对他完全改变了看法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's making me look at him totally differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前只是 "杰克盖勒  摩妮卡和罗斯的爸爸"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I mean, he used to be just "Jack Geller, Monica and Ross' dad."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他是 "杰克盖勒  梦中情人"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now he's "Jack Geller, dream hunk."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  对我来说他永远都是杰克盖勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. To me, he'll always be "Jack Geller...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你换衣服时闯进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...walks in while you're changing."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  钱德是罗斯最要好的朋友之一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Dad, Chandler is one of Ross' very best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯是个好青年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross sure is a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直觉得儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I've always felt that how a young man turns out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是父亲的翻版\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is a reflection on his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也有同感   请问你爸是做什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I always thought that too. Tell me, what does your father do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是同志歌舞秀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a headliner of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的头牌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...gay burlesque show.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你急死人了  快上甜点啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash, you're killing us. Will you serve the dessert already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒醉的舞者都在等我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's drunken dancers a-waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看  很漂亮吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at it. Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒果酱松糕  有很多层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a trifle. It's got all these layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先是一层小松糕   然后是果酱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First there's a layer of ladyfingers, then a layer of jam...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后是我自己做的乳蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then custard, which I made from scratch...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后是覆盖盆子  然后又是小松糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then raspberries, more ladyfingers...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后是豌豆洋葱炒嫩牛肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then beef sauteed with peas and onions...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后又有一点乳蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then a little bit more custard...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后是香蕉   最后再涂上鲜奶油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then bananas and then I put whipped cream on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香蕉前面是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was the one right before bananas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炒牛肉吗  我也觉得有点奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The beef. Yeah, that was weird to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想说  "连甜肉馅饼都有了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But then, y'know, I thought, "Well, there's minced meat pie."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一种英式甜点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's an English dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国人都放一堆怪东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These people just put very strange things in their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  可以跟你借兰姆酒吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the way, can I borrow rum from your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的时候你们可别偷吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And while I'm gone, don't you boys sneak a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜点加牛肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Beef in a dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不可能的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. There is no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊  而且果酱才一层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. And only one layer of jam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有搞错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两页黏在一起了  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The pages are stuck together. Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  她做了酒果酱松糕加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. She made half an English trifle and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肉馅马铃薯泥饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...half a shepherd's pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完了  她得重做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, now she's gonna start all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没办法带那些辣妹  认识新世界了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're never gonna get to introduce the hot girls to the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们可以  不要告诉她就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, we will. We just won't tell her she messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后让她上那个牛肉乳蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just let her serve the beef-custard thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这会是一个有趣的感恩节回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It'll be like a funny Thanksgiving story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呕吐的回忆  的确很有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vomiting stories are funny, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  天哪  你家热死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey. God, your apartment is like a hundred degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会不会想脱到只剩下内衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did it make you want to walk around in your underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不够热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still not hot enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  怎样  你看他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel. Okay, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看那双有力的手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at those strong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想当那瓶…炼乳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what I wouldn't give to be that can of condensed milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  钱德说你的毛衣很好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom, uh, Chandler was just saying how beautiful your sweater is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  这是新衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank you, Chandler. I just bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:10:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  很漂亮  米色的  很紧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Yes, well, it's very beautiful and it's cream-colored and tight and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是指很紧  不会很紧  我没有在看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't mean tight. It's not too tight. Not that I was looking at...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么搞的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概又嗑药了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think he's stoned again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, I need to talk to you a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大概知道  我爸妈为什么不喜欢你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think I might know why my parents don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  为什么  记不记得我们年轻的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do? Why? Okay, remember we were young. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大二的春假  我在房间里吸麻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Spring break, sophomore year, I got high in my bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸妈走进来闻到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and my parents walked in and smelled it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我就说你吸了麻   跳窗走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I told them that you had gotten stoned and jumped out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你为什么要赖给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我第一个想到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Uh, yours was the first name that popped into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我以为不会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I didn't think it'd matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能不会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could it not matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道我们会变成死党\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How was I to know we'd be friends after college...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更别提你会跟我妹同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...let alone you'd be living with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些 "生死之交"的豪语呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about all that "friends forever" stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得  我当时正嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I was all high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸妈叫我来看看  你是不是想找罗斯嗑药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom and Dad just sent me to find out if you were trying to get Ross stoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯大学吸麻被他们逮到  他居然赖给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your parents caught Ross smoking pot in college, and he blamed it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你怎么能这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I can't believe you'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们讨厌我  我们才没公开  麻烦你搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We haven't told them we're together because they hate me, okay? So you fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我会说吸麻的不是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, I'll tell them it wasn't Chandler who got high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我要说是谁呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, who should I say it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  这又没什么  你现在又没有嗑药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You. It's not like it's a big deal. You don't still do it or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  好啦  那我要说是谁骗我这么做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Now, who should I say tricked me into doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请别在这里剔牙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad, please don't pick your teeth out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要翘脚  怎么不坐   摩妮卡  不要烦他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if you're gonna put your feet up-Monica, leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:11:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你快点  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前没听到我说  吉宁的朋友都是舞者吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you not hear me when I told you that all of Janine's friends are dancers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且她们会喝很多酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? And that they're gonna be drinking a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是听到了  不过你再说一次  好浪漫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I did. But tell me again because it's so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打得好慢  不能快一点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're whipping so slow. Can't you do it any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我不想犯错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, come on, I don't want to make any mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜点只有这一道   要是我搞砸   大家会说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the only dessert. If I screw it up, everybody's gonna be like:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"记得那次感恩节  瑞秋把酒果酱松糕做坏了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Oh, remember that Thanksgiving when Rachel screwed up the trifle?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以让我来做  你只管担心吃的部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So just let me worry about making the trifle and you just worry about eating it.alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是很担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你再不说  我就要说了  好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, if you don't tell them, then I will. Okay. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你可以来一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, can I talk to you for a second? Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下好吗   乔伊  我有事要告诉我爸吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can it wait a second, Joey? I have to tell my parents something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能等  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it can't? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们应该告诉瑞秋  她甜点做错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, I think we have to tell Rachel she messed up her dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  大家都是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What is with everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是感恩节  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Thanksgiving, not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告秘日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Truth Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等大家吃到那道香蕉肉甜点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, when everyone eats that banana-meat thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会取笑她  那样的话也好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they'll all make fun of her. Do you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们就叫大家假装喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. We'll just get everyone to act like they like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样就不会有人取笑她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That way, no one makes fun of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也可以去找那些小辣椒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we still get to go to sweet potato pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  别把她们物化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, they're not objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑的  我去告诉大家  你把瑞秋拖开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just kidding. I'll talk to them. You distract her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  可以出去谈一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, can I talk to you outside for a sec'?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感恩节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岁末季节又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The holiday season is upon us, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you look nice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.61,0:14:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  罗斯  不要这样  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. No, Ross, don't do this. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们不适合复合了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't think us getting back together is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就料到会这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought this might happen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我知道逢年过节特别难熬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I know the holidays can be rough...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你一个人八成很辛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's probably really hard for you to be alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我跟菲比住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I live with Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就真的只有一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you're alone-alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  但这个时机真的不对   抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's just not the time for us. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总得试试看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well. Can't blame a guy for trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有人不知道怎么装\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, if anyone needs help pretending to like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在表演课学过  你们可以摸摸肚子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I learned some things in acting class. Try, uh, rubbing your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是说 "嗯"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or, uh, saying "Mm."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加上微笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, oh, smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不花钱  让你去上表演课了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm not gonna pay for those acting classes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你回来了  快上甜点吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, there you are. Come on, Let's serve that dessert already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   别再催我了  你知道吗   罚你不准吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you have to stop rushing me. You know what? You don't get any dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骗你的  我才不会虐待你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, just kidding. I would never do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  各位  酒果酱松糕时间到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, everybody, it's trifle time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是英式酒果酱松糕  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, now, Rach, this is a traditional English trifle, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It sure is. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是加牛肉还是茄子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you make it with beef or eggplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.45,0:15:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牛肉  我不能吃  你也知道我不吃肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Beet I can't have any. I don't eat meat. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我要你第一个品尝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, I want you to have the first taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你只挖了鲜奶油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, you only got whipped cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得挖到每一层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta take a bite with all the layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你掉了一颗豌豆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You dropped a pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  多好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? How good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so good that I feel really selfish...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人吃会过意不去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about being the only one who's eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该让每个人都享用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we should have everyone taste how good it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好吃了  我要去阳台吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. This is so good that I'm gonna go enjoy it on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,边看风景边享用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that I can enjoy the view whilst I enjoy my dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去房里打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've gotta call my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我的朋友玛丽有多好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and tell her how good this is from Monica's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你拨号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll help you dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去浴室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go into the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,边吃边照镜子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I can look at it in the mirror as I eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事  不好吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what was that all about? Does it not taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃吃看  什么  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me try it. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许钱德还有剩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe Chandler has some left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,味道好像洗脚水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It tastes like feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不好  乳蛋糕  赞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's not to like? Custard, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果酱  赞  牛肉  赞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jam, good. Meat, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一只乌就这样一把抢过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So a bird just grabbed it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想带着它飞走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then tried to fly away with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果就掉到马路上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then just dropped it on the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  不过值得安慰的是  掉下去之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but, if it's any consolation, before the bird dropped it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好像吃得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...he seemed to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  来一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚小睡了一觉  又梦到杰克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just taking my Thanksgiving nap and I had another dream about Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我会想听吗  我不知道  你听听看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, do I want to hear this? I don't know, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我梦到我们正要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I dreamt we were getting married...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果他离开去救火\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he left because he had to go fight a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我去一家夜总会  却看到他在跟一个女孩亲热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, um, so, okay, I went to a nightclub and I saw him making outwith a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  他在梦里背叛你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, he dream-cheated on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但这时贾克库斯托出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. But then Jacques Cousteau came...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我教训了他一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he kicked his ass for betraying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好酷喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他带我去潜水  跟我介绍他养的海马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then he took me diving and introduced me to his pet sea horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直对我献殷勤  但是怎么可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who was coming on to me. And, please, that is not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我今天系了大皮带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy, I'm glad I wore the big belt today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟前  那种话会让我神魂颠倒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Five minutes ago, a line like that would have floored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在却毫无作用   一点点啦  我毕竟是女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But now, nothing. Well, not nothing. I am still a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于告诉爸妈这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. About telling Mom and Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我考虑用写信的方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was thinking about maybe writing a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  我给过你机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? That's it. You've had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  爸  罗斯大学吸过麻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom, Dad. Ross smoked pot in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个告密者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are such a tattletale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom, Dad, heh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得你们在我房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you remember that time you walked in my room...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闻到大麻的事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and smelled marijuana?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得 记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说吸麻的是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you it was Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who was smoking the pot but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it was me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  害他被革职的邮差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, Dad, you know that mailman that you got fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有偷你的《花花公子》   是罗斯偷的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He didn't steal your Playboys. Ross did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:20:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前廊的秋千椅不是暴风雨弄坏的  是摩妮卡坐坏的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Hurricane Gloria didn't break the porch swing. Monica did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯已经离开博物馆一年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross hasn't worked at the museum for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德在同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and Chandler are living together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯在赌城娶了瑞秋  然后又离婚了  又一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross married Rachel in Vegas. And got divorced. Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱贾克库斯托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love Jacques Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒果酱松糕里不该放牛肉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't supposed to put beef in the trifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想走啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这三十秒真是高潮不断啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a lot of information to get in 3O seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  乔伊  你想走就走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Joey, if you want to leave, just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  这道甜点的确不能放肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, no, you weren't supposed to put beef in the trifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It did not taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贾克库斯托已经死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I think Jacques Cousteau is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我真不懂  你为何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, why you felt you had to hide the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要隐瞒一段重要的感情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that you're in an important relationship is beyond me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.25,0:21:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实秋千椅的事我们心里有数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we kind of figured about the porch swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗑药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三度离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Divorced again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了  儿子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都是遭人哄骗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}L-I, uh-I got tricked into all those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.39,0:21:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你一直是罗斯的好朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you've been Ross' best friend all these years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在他嗑药时仍不放弃他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...stuck by him during the drug problems...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你又照顾起摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and now you've taken on Monica as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个大好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a wonderful human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.71,0:21:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  罗斯  我真不知道该拿你们怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and Ross, I don't know what I'm gonna do about the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:21:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟他们谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  香蕉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys, it was bananas...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶油加牛肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...cream and beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然因为怕我难过而吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just cannot believe that you ate that so that I wouldn't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我没吃  还放在浴室里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, actually, I didn't eat mine. It's still in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我吃掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No it isn't, I ate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的在摩妮卡的房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we left ours in Monica's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  被我吃了  你的也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nope, got it and got yours too.
